    "description": "<p>This smart-fabric privacy cloak conceals you like a burkha, randomly stiffens and relaxes to confuse gait analysis, and randomly shifts heat patterns. It emits pheromones, odorants, and white noise, deterring scent identification and eavesdropping. It can also function as a faraday cage, blocking mesh signals and preventing any trackers you carry from broadcasting. Shrouds are an acceptable form of privacy in some habitats, but considered gauche or illegal in others.</p>",
